(7189597, 1104719, 124190, '<td valign="top">Oh geez....how did I miss this....must have lost my head....I thought I commented on all shots in this challenge...sorry....  looks like a nice warm day in the park.</td>', 'Oh geez....how did I miss this....must have lost my head....I thought I commented on all shots in this challenge...sorry....  looks like a nice warm day in the park.', '2014-03-14 08:50:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7189598, 1105055, 114969, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Alessandro! It is a great pleasure to see your work rewarded as it should, given the creativity and execution quality. It is true it was not that easy to find a good word to illustrate, especially for non-native speakers, and your choice is perfect. Well done!</td>', 'Congratulations Alessandro! It is a great pleasure to see your work rewarded as it should, given the creativity and execution quality. It is true it was not that easy to find a good word to illustrate, especially for non-native speakers, and your choice is perfect. Well done!', '2014-03-14 08:51:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7189599, 1105055, 114969, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Alessandro! It is a great pleasure to see your work rewarded as it should, given the creativity and execution quality. It is true it was not that easy to find a good word to illustrate, especially for non-native speakers, and your choice is perfect. Well done!</td>', 'Congratulations Alessandro! It is a great pleasure to see your work rewarded as it should, given the creativity and execution quality. It is true it was not that easy to find a good word to illustrate, especially for non-native speakers, and your choice is perfect. Well done!', '2014-03-14 08:51:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7189600, 1104711, 114969, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Sterling on your first ribbon! I am convinced it is the first of a long collection. Humor, lighting, posing, acting, you definitely have it all!</td>', 'Congratulations Sterling on your first ribbon! I am convinced it is the first of a long collection. Humor, lighting, posing, acting, you definitely have it all!', '2014-03-14 08:53:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7189602, 1104475, 114969, '<td valign="top">Looking at your work is like touching the colors of some edible sound. I don''t know how you manage to mix all the human sensations this way, but it damn works.</td>', 'Looking at your work is like touching the colors of some edible sound. I don''t know how you manage to mix all the human sensations this way, but it damn works.', '2014-03-14 09:03:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7189603, 1105036, 77196, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo. Definite and immediate emotional connection, with enough "What the...?" to make you stop and study it.</td>', 'Awesome photo. Definite and immediate emotional connection, with enough "What the...?" to make you stop and study it.', '2014-03-14 09:06:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7189605, 1104852, 114969, '<td valign="top">When I look at your photo, and when I read your notes, I am so glad I am not a balloon! Congratulations Katie. It is very well done: what I especially love is your look... those eyes are so convincing! It really makes the image.</td>', 'When I look at your photo, and when I read your notes, I am so glad I am not a balloon! Congratulations Katie. It is very well done: what I especially love is your look... those eyes are so convincing! It really makes the image.', '2014-03-14 09:14:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7189607, 1104659, 114969, '<td valign="top">It''s definitely an excellent idea, and I love how you did not forget to address the reflection of the eye in the water. Congratulations on the nice finish!</td>', 'It''s definitely an excellent idea, and I love how you did not forget to address the reflection of the eye in the water. Congratulations on the nice finish!', '2014-03-14 09:16:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7189609, 1105054, 114969, '<td valign="top">Yes, it is excellent indeed! What a fantastic concept, clever and full of humor. Congratulations on the nice finish.</td>', 'Yes, it is excellent indeed! What a fantastic concept, clever and full of humor. Congratulations on the nice finish.', '2014-03-14 09:48:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7189610, 1105036, 114969, '<td valign="top">I''m so glad you''re back. Please pay no attention to the low votes: they are simply insignificant, and the reasons behind them will never make you any better at what you do anyway. I am personally convinced that negative feedback is useless: no one has the right to tell you what you shouldn''t be doing. On the other hand, I know many who greatly enjoy your creations, who appreciate the way you manage to transmit your mood and views through photography. I definitely am one of them, and I hope to see many more of your pictures soon.</td>', 'I''m so glad you''re back. Please pay no attention to the low votes: they are simply insignificant, and the reasons behind them will never make you any better at what you do anyway. I am personally convinced that negative feedback is useless: no one has the right to tell you what you shouldn''t be doing. On the other hand, I know many who greatly enjoy your creations, who appreciate the way you manage to transmit your mood and views through photography. I definitely am one of them, and I hope to see many more of your pictures soon.', '2014-03-14 09:55:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7189613, 1105054, 96751, '<td valign="top">Charming and whimsical, with a twist.  Congrats on the tt. Where did you get that phone???<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-03-14 10:38:20.</i></td>', 'Charming and whimsical, with a twist.  Congrats on the tt. Where did you get that phone???', '2014-03-14 10:37:56.000000', '2014-03-14 10:38:20.000000', 0),
