(7189658, 1105040, 59029, '<td valign="top">Excellent work as always, Christophe.  Grats on the red!<br/> <br/>ETA: Wow, what a story.  I do hope she recovers fully.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-03-14 12:01:25.</i></td>', 'Excellent work as always, Christophe.  Grats on the red! ETA: Wow, what a story.  I do hope she recovers fully.', '2014-03-14 11:59:32.000000', '2014-03-14 12:01:25.000000', 0),
(7189660, 1104711, 59029, '<td valign="top">Ridiculously silly and funny idea and technically beautiful too.  Very well done, congrats on the first of many ribbons!<br/> <br/>ETA: You''re a Canadian too, even better, there are few Canuckistanian ribbon hawgs here :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-03-14 12:03:23.</i></td>', 'Ridiculously silly and funny idea and technically beautiful too.  Very well done, congrats on the first of many ribbons! ETA: You''re a Canadian too, even better, there are few Canuckistanian ribbon hawgs here :-)', '2014-03-14 12:02:20.000000', '2014-03-14 12:03:23.000000', 0),
