(7190146, 1105040, 123833, '<td valign="top">Yes, I was really worried reading your story, I thought - has the photography taken over everything in your life!?? How serious is the disease?? Why not see the doctor instead of taking photos!!? :) Anyway, I read it to the end - congrats!! I hope she feels better soon. Great image and great cooperation on all levels. I am looking forward to your take on new life :)</td>', 'Yes, I was really worried reading your story, I thought - has the photography taken over everything in your life!?? How serious is the disease?? Why not see the doctor instead of taking photos!!? :) Anyway, I read it to the end - congrats!! I hope she feels better soon. Great image and great cooperation on all levels. I am looking forward to your take on new life :)', '2014-03-16 00:38:42.000000', NULL, 0),
